  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Figure 1: the literature-search query as four groups of alternative words joined left to right — {Automatic, Automated, …} → {Term, Terminology, …} → {Extraction, Recognition, Detection, Retrieval, …} → {Data, Dataset, Corpus, Corpora, …}. A bracket under the first three groups is labelled 'Methods/Systems', and a longer bracket under all four is labelled 'Datasets': the first three groups found the systems surveyed, all four found the datasets.",
